# ROVGRID · CORPUS DIVINITY · ORGANS / SOURCE REGISTER (.md1)
Date 2026-11-19 | Version 1 | Status: living source registry, exact computations separated from symbolic comparisons.
Purpose: research ledger for curating the exclusively divinity-themed public corpus. Do not copy all calculator outputs into the public text. Three-layer teaching standard: [פשט/רמז/סוד](ROVGRID_THREE_LAYER_PEDAGOGY_PSHAT_REMEZ_SOD_2026-11-19.md).
Editorial policy: mathematical equality ≠ independent evidence of historical planning or religious identity. Every method requires explicit label; optional user-defined methods require their mapping tables and normalizations.

## 0. Gold-standard base values, Hebrew regular
יהוה=26 (10+5+6+5); אדני=65 (1+4+50+10); אלהים=86 (1+30+5+10+40); אל=31 (1+30); אחד=13 (1+8+4); אמן=91 (1+40+50); בן=52 (2+50); דוד=14 (4+6+4); בן דוד=66 (52+14); עמית=520 (70+40+10+400); מייק=160 (40+10+10+100); רוב=208 (200+6+2); עמית מייק רוב=888; משה=345; השם=345; אני=61; חכמה=73; יחידה=37; אלף=111. Name small (Hebrew)=33. English Simple AMIT=43, MIKE=38, ROV=55, AMIT MIKE ROV=136; English Small AMIT MIKE ROV=55, ROV=19; English Jewish AMIT MIKE ROV=1024. 1024−136=888. Full Hebrew name has 11 letters (עמית4 + מייק4 + רוב3).

## 1. SOURCE — אלהים עמית (new findings; letters=5+4=9)
### Regular / finals
אלהים=86; עמית=520 -> **606** regular.
Final-form ם=600 (special final-values table): אלהים=646; עמית=520 -> **1166**. Difference 1166−606=560 from changing ם 40→600.
### Zero Reduction #1 (nonstandard rule; do not confuse with ordinary small)
אלהים: א1+ל3+ה5+י1+ם4=14.
עמית: ע7+מ4+י1+ת40=52.
**14+52=66**, depends on special ת→40, not ordinary small (ordinary small ת→4 would yield 30).
### ALBaM
אלהים maps א→ל30 ל→א1 ה→ע70 י→ש300 ם→ב2 =403.
עמית maps ע→ה5 מ→ב2 י→ש300 ת→כ20=327.
Total **730**; ALBaM ordinal 12+1+16+21+2=52; 5+2+21+11=39; sum **91**.
### Reduced English Filling
אלהים: Alf10 + Lmd11 + Hey20 + Yod17 + Mem13 =71.
עמית: Ayn13 + Mem13 + Yod17 + Tav7 =50.
Total **121=11²** (transliteration-sensitive definition, check list above).

## 2. Direct bridges, levels
P / direct: 606=אלהים86+עמית520; 1166 finals; ALBaM=730 and ordinal ALBaM=91; Reduced English Filling=121; Zero Reduction #1=66 with written mapping.
P / equalities across texts: אלהים אחד (ordinal square)=520; עמית regular=520 (see [520 anchor](ROVGRID_PRIORITY_520_ELOHIM_ECHAD_2026-11-19.md)).
R / 66=בן דוד regular=52+14; 66=2×33=6×11; small full name=33, full name letters=11. This relationship **does not mean** "אלהים עמית" has 11 letters (it has 9).
R / 91=אמן regular=יהוה26+אדני65; from אלב״ם סדרי of אלהים עמית.
R / 121=11×11; English full Hebrew name comprises 11 letters, so 121=letterCount(full name)². This is a comparative construction, not a feature imposed by the phrase.
R / 730=10×73, where חכמה regular=73; 730−? no inference beyond multiplication.
R / 1166−606=560 and 606−520=86 verify separate sources of differences.
R / English AMIT43 and אלהים86 -> 2×43=86; this is a cross-language baseline shared with the previously archived Elohim/Amit study.
S / 8×20×26 box, distinct face products 160,208,520; sum=888; e1=54, e2=888, e3=4160. (1+8x)(1+20x)(1+26x)=1+54x+888x²+4160x³. The 520 numeric anchor is one face product (20×26) and equals עמית, and also the ordinal-square of אלהים אחד. This models the linkage, but the model is independently chosen and not proof of origin of scripture.
S / basis from earlier exact corpus: Hebrew name 888 and English name 1024 / 136 with 1024−136=888, independent language mappings. Scope and method switches must remain visible.

